# SMMPro Development - Complete Setup Prompt for TRAE.AI

## Project Overview
Create a complete Social Media Management Platform called SMMPro with AI-powered video editing, automated content generation, and multi-platform scheduling. This is a full-stack application with backend APIs, web dashboard, mobile app, and AI microservices.

## Initial Project Structure Setup

**First, create the main project directory and initialize all components:**

```
Create project directory: smmpro-platform
├── backend/ (Node.js + Express API)
├── frontend/ (React + Vite web dashboard)
├── mobile/ (React Native app)
├── ai-services/ (Python AI microservices)
├── infrastructure/ (Docker + AWS configs)
├── docs/ (Documentation and specs)
└── scripts/ (Automation and deployment scripts)
```

